## 15. Key Retrieval Metrics

- **R@1**: fraction of test samples whose ground truth is the top-1 retrieved item (primary metric)
- **R@5, R@10**: top-5/10 retrieval accuracy
- **MRR**: mean reciprocal rank
- **Median Rank**: median position of ground truth in ranked gallery
- Gallery = all CLIP embeddings in the validation/test set

## 16. Novel Contributions (N-series experiments)

- **N1 (vMF-NCE)**: von Mises-Fisher distribution on the hypersphere. Bessel-free NCE loss. Softplus kappa (v7+). R-Drop regularization, label smoothing, projection head separation (v9).
- **N2 (ROI Transformer)**: brain-topology-aware tokenization — 17 ROI tokens processed by Transformer. Multi-subject joint training (v7+). Stochastic Depth (v9).
- **N3 (ROI-DCF)**: Directional Consensus Fusion — per-ROI vMF expert heads fused via spherical weighted averaging. Dual uncertainty: kappa + delta.
- **N4 (Full System)**: all innovations + SPCL curriculum + DUA-CFG for diffusion.

### V9-specific innovations (all N-series)
- **ContrastiveProjectionHead**: 768->2048->768 MLP separating contrastive from retrieval representation
- **R-Drop**: symmetric KL divergence between two vMF forward passes with different dropout masks
- **CSLS retrieval**: Cross-domain Similarity Local Scaling corrects hubness in validation retrieval
- **MC-Dropout TTA**: 8 forward passes with dropout at test time, averaged predictions
- **Kappa-weighted averaging**: repetition averaging weighted by model confidence (kappa)
- **bf16 mixed precision**: H100-native, eliminates AMP overflow risks
